r to 117.0.5938.62 allowed a remote attacker to spoof security UI via a crafted HTML page. (Chromium security severity: Medium)\", \"cve_from_sw_analysis\": true, \"cve_id\": \"CVE-2023-4905\", \"cve_severity\": \"MEDIUM\", \"cvss\": 4.3, \"cvss3_score\": \"4.3\", \"cvss3_score_num\": 4.3, \"cvss_str\": \"CVSS 4.3\", \"cvss_version\": \"v3.0\", \"cwe_id\": [\"NVD-CWE-noinfo\"], \"exploitability_score\": 2.8, \"impact_score\": 1.4, \"last_modified_date\": \"Wed, 31 Jan 2024 17:15:17 GMT\", \"publish_date\": \"Tue, 12 Sep 2023 21:15:08 GMT\", \"software_name\": \"google chrome\", \"software_vendor\": \"google inc.\", \"software_version\": \"104.0.5112.88\", \"version_raw\": \"000000104000000000000511200000088\"}, {\"cve_description\": \"Heap buffer overflow in Media Galleries in Google Chrome prior to 107.0.5304.62 allowed an attacker who convinced a user to install a malicious extension to potentially exploit heap corruption via a crafted HTML page. (Chromium security severity: Medium)\", \"cve_from_sw_analysis\": true, \"cve_id\": \"CVE-2022-3655\", \"cve_severity\": \"HIGH\", \"cvss\": 8.8, \"cvss3_score\": \"8.8\", \"cvss3_score_num\": 8.8, \"cvss_str\": \"CVSS 8.8\", \"cvss_version\": \"v3.0\", \"cwe_id\": [\"CWE-787\"], \"exploitability_score\": 2.8, \"impact_score\": 5.9, \"last_modified_date\": \"Fri, 09 Dec 2022 15:46:30 GMT\", \"publish_date\": \"Tue, 01 Nov 2022 23:15:18 GMT\", \"software_name\": \"google chrome\", \"software_vendor\": \"google inc.\", \"software_version\": \"104.0.5112.88\", \"version_raw\": \"000000104000000000000511200000088\"}, {\"cve_description\": \"Use after free in Blink History in Google Chrome prior to 118.0.5993.70 allowed a remote attacker to potentially exploit heap corruption via a crafted HTML page. (Chromium security severity: Medium)\", \"cve_from_sw_analysis\": true, \"cve_id\": \"CVE-2023-5476\", \"cve_severity\": \"HIGH\", \"cvss\": 8.8, \"cvss3_score\": \"8.8\", \"cvss3_score_num\": 8.8, \"cvss_str\": \"CVSS 8.8\", \"cv